  "prefLabel": "Lot 8107.01 Annual Report",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 8107.01 Annual Report. No later than April 15 of each year, the ADW provider shall file with the commission a report, regarding New Hampshire account holders, detailing the following for the previous calendar year in which ADW was offered:\n\n(a) Total handle processed through their ADW platform(s);\n\n(b) Total handle segregated by telephone, internet, and mobile application;\n\n(c) Total handle segregated by track;\n\n(d) Total handle segregated by ADW affiliate; and\n\n(e) The beginning number of accounts, total accounts opened and closed, and the ending number of accounts.\n\nSource. #14448, eff 12-3-25, EXPIRES: 12-3-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot8100.html"
}
